    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Bribe your enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/f448b1a712e5c76b02aec65085324de7.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/f448b1a712e5c76b02aec65085324de7.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/f448b1a712e5c76b02aec65085324de7.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You no longer need to simply defeat your enemies! <br>Offer them gold and turn them to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear down their health to break their fighting spirit, and eventually they\u2019ll have no choice but to accept your offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2.\u00a0Position your mercenaries on the battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/739000c85ac86354d7ef176421950412.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/739000c85ac86354d7ef176421950412.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/739000c85ac86354d7ef176421950412.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strategy can lead your entire team to victory\u2014or total defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3.\u00a0Command your mercenaries to annihilate your foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/c6a0fe6bbca53d29f3b52f139e55f8b9.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/c6a0fe6bbca53d29f3b52f139e55f8b9.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/c6a0fe6bbca53d29f3b52f139e55f8b9.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can order your mercenaries whom to attack and where to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under your command, your mercenaries will wipe out the enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4.\u00a0Combine cards, relics, and mercenaries to create the ultimate synergy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/e26a603c2159c91f1535107edcbb0324.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/e26a603c2159c91f1535107edcbb0324.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/e26a603c2159c91f1535107edcbb0324.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving the battle alone is not enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your remaining gold wisely to earn more interest, and strengthen your deck and team even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger your combinations of cards, relics, and mercenaries, the smoother your future expeditions will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5.\u00a0Escape the dungeon and bring your recruited mercenaries with you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/b9d5aa14bfd12dafb0b5e04a8c3cfb3d.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/b9d5aa14bfd12dafb0b5e04a8c3cfb3d.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/b9d5aa14bfd12dafb0b5e04a8c3cfb3d.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You no longer need to Slay the Dungeon \u2014 Escape the Dungeon instead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve the mercenaries you\u2019ve recruited, along with the cards and relics you\u2019ve collected, and expand your resources even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will help you prepare more thoroughly for your next dungeon run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, anything lost inside the dungeon cannot be recovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right moment to escape carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6.\u00a0Don\u2019t linger too long in the dungeon.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/27020896b8cf2363bc390a0fb974562c.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/27020896b8cf2363bc390a0fb974562c.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/27020896b8cf2363bc390a0fb974562c.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t test the dungeon\u2019s patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the higher the danger level grows\u2014and the stronger the monsters you\u2019ll face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path carefully to avoid raising the danger level too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And escape before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Bribe your enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/f448b1a712e5c76b02aec65085324de7.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/f448b1a712e5c76b02aec65085324de7.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/f448b1a712e5c76b02aec65085324de7.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You no longer need to simply defeat your enemies! <br>Offer them gold and turn them to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear down their health to break their fighting spirit, and eventually they\u2019ll have no choice but to accept your offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2.\u00a0Position your mercenaries on the battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/739000c85ac86354d7ef176421950412.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/739000c85ac86354d7ef176421950412.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/739000c85ac86354d7ef176421950412.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strategy can lead your entire team to victory\u2014or total defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3.\u00a0Command your mercenaries to annihilate your foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/c6a0fe6bbca53d29f3b52f139e55f8b9.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/c6a0fe6bbca53d29f3b52f139e55f8b9.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/c6a0fe6bbca53d29f3b52f139e55f8b9.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can order your mercenaries whom to attack and where to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under your command, your mercenaries will wipe out the enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4.\u00a0Combine cards, relics, and mercenaries to create the ultimate synergy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/e26a603c2159c91f1535107edcbb0324.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/e26a603c2159c91f1535107edcbb0324.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/e26a603c2159c91f1535107edcbb0324.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving the battle alone is not enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your remaining gold wisely to earn more interest, and strengthen your deck and team even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger your combinations of cards, relics, and mercenaries, the smoother your future expeditions will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5.\u00a0Escape the dungeon and bring your recruited mercenaries with you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/b9d5aa14bfd12dafb0b5e04a8c3cfb3d.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/b9d5aa14bfd12dafb0b5e04a8c3cfb3d.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/b9d5aa14bfd12dafb0b5e04a8c3cfb3d.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You no longer need to Slay the Dungeon \u2014 Escape the Dungeon instead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve the mercenaries you\u2019ve recruited, along with the cards and relics you\u2019ve collected, and expand your resources even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will help you prepare more thoroughly for your next dungeon run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, anything lost inside the dungeon cannot be recovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right moment to escape carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6.\u00a0Don\u2019t linger too long in the dungeon.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/27020896b8cf2363bc390a0fb974562c.poster.avif?t=1754320342\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/27020896b8cf2363bc390a0fb974562c.webm?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656680/extras/27020896b8cf2363bc390a0fb974562c.mp4?t=1754320342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t test the dungeon\u2019s patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the higher the danger level grows\u2014and the stronger the monsters you\u2019ll face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path carefully to avoid raising the danger level too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And escape before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
